{"version":1,"content":"<p>入村搵食，有種尋寶感覺，因為總有驚喜發現。</p><p>位處繁忙的大圍公共運輸交匯處附近的田心村，開設了不少特色小店，像日系木屋Cafe、隱秘泰菜餐廳，以及低調台式小店，最重要是，3間店都設室外座位，可以與毛孩一齊歎美食。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;村內一間3</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:34:39.776076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:03.782751+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:03.782751+00:00","content_hash":"e362d23cac284167f6cce967692b8b1bae1c993c313ed7b20e353675797d6422","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}